DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
22301::$$$message_0176_0000_0000$$$::   I had such a dream.[wait canskip=0 time=1000]::
22302::$$$message_0176_0001_0000$$$::It still isn't 6:00 AM when I wake up.[lr]::
22303::$$$message_0176_0001_0001$$$::The light filtering through the window is somewhat strong, and the air coming between the panel's seams is somewhat cold.[lr]::
22304::$$$message_0176_0001_0002$$$::"...Damn it. I did it again."[lr]::
22305::$$$message_0176_0001_0003$$$::The summer heat is over. I remember it's already October.[lr]::
22306::$$$message_0176_0001_0004$$$::It's now the season where it's uncomfortable to sleep without a blanket.::
22307::$$$message_0176_0002_0000$$$::"Last night, um..."[lr]::
22308::$$$message_0176_0002_0001$$$::I spur my not-quite-awake brain to action.[lr]::
22309::$$$message_0176_0002_0002$$$::Last night, I think I did maintenance on Bicycle No.1, changed the chain on Bicycle No.2, and then drifted off to sleep with nothing better to do.::
22310::$$$message_0176_0003_0000$$$::"...Ow. Shouldn't have gone to sleep on the floor... It's already winter, so I need to start using the entire futon set."[lr]::
22311::$$$message_0176_0003_0001$$$::I roll my shoulder and breathe.[se storage=se288.wav]::
22312::$$$message_0176_0004_0000$$$::Breakfast in the Emiya household begins at 6:30.[lr]::
22313::$$$message_0176_0004_0001$$$::There's still plenty of time until then, but only if you aren't the one cooking.[lr]::
22314::$$$message_0176_0004_0002$$$::I have to get up at least thirty minutes before breakfast to have enough time to make it.::
22315::$$$message_0176_0005_0000$$$::"Lately, Sakura's been waking me up after she makes breakfast... When did she become someone who likes taking a guy's hobbies away from him?"::
22316::$$$message_0176_0006_0000$$$::It can only be her sister's influence.[lr]::
22317::$$$message_0176_0006_0001$$$::Anyway, it means I have to get up before six if I want to make breakfast myself.[lr]::
22318::$$$message_0176_0006_0002$$$::As the man of the house[line len=2]no, as her cooking instructor, I can't let my pupil get ahead of me.::
22319::$$$message_0176_0007_0000$$$::As soon as I go into the hallway, I smell breakfast.[lr]::
22320::$$$message_0176_0007_0001$$$::I also hear the studied, rhythmic chopping of a kitchen knife.[lr]::
22321::$$$message_0176_0007_0002$$$::It looks like breakfast is already eighty percent complete.::
22322::$$$message_0176_0008_0000$$$::It's a pleasant morning and a typical scene.[lr]::
22323::$$$message_0176_0008_0001$$$::I decide to roll with it.[lr]::
22324::$$$message_0176_0008_0002$$$::"Oh, good morning, Shirou. You slept in a bit today."[lr]::
22325::$$$message_0176_0008_0003$$$::I see her smile.::
22326::$$$message_0176_0009_0000$$$::"Shirou? What's wrong? You're very quiet.[lr]::
22327::$$$message_0176_0009_0001$$$::Is there something on my face?"[lr]::
22328::$$$message_0176_0009_0002$$$::Half a year ago...[lr]::
22329::$$$message_0176_0009_0003$$$::Something like this happened, when the weather was still cold.[lr]::
22330::$$$message_0176_0009_0004$$$::I...::
22331::$$$message_0176_0010_0000$$$::"...You look pale. [cacheimage storage=セイバー私服02c(中)][wvl][chgfg textoff=0 time=300 storage=セイバー私服02c(中)]Don't tell me you went to sleep in the shed again.[lr]::
22332::$$$message_0176_0010_0001$$$::Shirou, I admire your dedication to your training, but only a neophyte does it to the detriment of his health."[lr]::
22333::$$$message_0176_0010_0002$$$::Yeah. I'm still a rookie, after all.[lr]::
22334::$$$message_0176_0010_0003$$$::It's been half a year since the Holy Grail War.[lr]::
22335::$$$message_0176_0010_0004$$$::People don't grow up that easily.::
22336::$$$message_0176_0011_0000$$$::"Did you hear me, Shirou? Look, now that Rin is away, I have the responsibility of looking after you.[lr]::
22337::$$$message_0176_0011_0001$$$::And I have a few thoughts about your unhealthy lifestyle."[lr]::
22338::$$$message_0176_0011_0002$$$::That's right.[lr]::
22339::$$$message_0176_0011_0003$$$::Tohsaka isn't here, so Saber's in charge of maintaining discipline in our house.[lr]::
22340::$$$message_0176_0011_0004$$$::Anyway...::
22341::$$$message_0176_0012_0000$$$::"What kind of thoughts?"[lr]::
22342::$$$message_0176_0012_0001$$$::"It's the thing you dislike most. If you can't keep verbal promises, then someone needs to be physically nearby to guide you.[lr]::
22343::$$$message_0176_0012_0002$$$::If you refuse to learn your lesson, then I will start sleeping next to you, in your room."[lr]::
22344::$$$message_0176_0012_0003$$$::"Mrgh."[lr]::
22345::$$$message_0176_0012_0004$$$::She utters a terrifying suggestion with a smile.::
22346::$$$message_0176_0013_0000$$$::Saber sleeps in the guesthouse's Japanese-style room.[lr]::
22347::$$$message_0176_0013_0001$$$::Back when I asked her to move out of the room next to mine...[lr]::
22348::$$$message_0176_0013_0002$$$::"I refuse. There is no reason for me to change my lodgings."[lr]::
22349::$$$message_0176_0013_0003$$$::...she was pretty stubborn about it. In the end, I convinced her that a bodyguard wasn't necessary now that the war was over.::
22350::$$$message_0176_0014_0000$$$::That happened a little while ago.[lr]::
22351::$$$message_0176_0014_0001$$$::Since then, I recovered the composure every healthy young man should have.::
22352::$$$message_0176_0015_0000$$$::"...I regret what I did. Starting tomorrow, I'll make sure to sleep in my bedroom."[lr]::
22353::$$$message_0176_0015_0001$$$::"Very good... Well, I have mixed feelings about forcing this so immediately, but it's for your own health.[lr]::
22354::$$$message_0176_0015_0002$$$::While I would feel more comfortable protecting you at your side, concessions must be made to let you sleep soundly."::
22355::$$$message_0176_0016_0000$$$::Saber heads off to the living room.[lr]::
22356::$$$message_0176_0016_0001$$$::It's only natural. Who would feel yearning for a typical morning conversation?[lr]::
22357::$$$message_0176_0016_0002$$$::But I forgot to greet her.[lr]::
22358::$$$message_0176_0016_0003$$$::I need to make sure to do that here.::
22359::$$$message_0176_0017_0000$$$::"Saber."::
22360::$$$message_0176_0018_0000$$$::"Good morning. I hope you have a good day."[lr]::
22361::$$$message_0176_0018_0001$$$::"Yes. You too, Shirou."::
22362::$$$message_0176_0019_0000$$$::I go to the living room with Saber.[lr]::
22363::$$$message_0176_0019_0001$$$::For some reason, my vision feels foggy, [shock hmax=20 time=1200 count=5]and I rub my eyes.[lr]::
22364::$$$message_0176_0019_0002$$$::"...Huh?"[lr]::
22365::$$$message_0176_0019_0003$$$::My eyes are a little wet.[lr]::
22366::$$$message_0176_0019_0004$$$::It's a pleasant, typical morning I've seen countless times.[lr]::
22367::$$$message_0176_0019_0005$$$::I must be so happy that I yawned.::

